{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":45,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T19:59:49.914640869Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"67df1b18-4065-4185-b87e-1eb8683f1d46","comment_uuid":"d4ae49c4-a67f-4214-85a6-3645f3e694a9","author":"tLiK","content":"NO DIVERGENCE FOUND. Transcription-oracle probes of 4 seams (magic->entry-width dispatch, header field offsets, address_mode version-bit extraction, Zen-gen id table) all matched; combo projection NOT pinned (upstream never parses 2PSP/2BHD as Directory; differential drops combos as equivalent). Bonus: ComboEntry layout DOES match fet.py:104-117 (doc-author's concern resolved). Tertiary 0x48/0x4A gap == existing #7 (not duped). directory.rs unit clean.","created_at":"2026-07-11T19:59:49.904748542Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAlmeCp1AN4hqV4dIlifMSkTmtlHci6RR9Z64IDvZRYkSmSisWr8m660n+GtXgZduN98J6+pUR761Gzj2m6nV5BQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBR2+HjU9HUAusWYYckKx6Shpw8xWrMsAsMTf1LwIAFrJU8dMPS3hTHr0tyM0mYOyiKYIOULxdFxf9g/mgeAiQE="}
