{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":70,"timestamp":"2026-07-11T22:33:10.036691537Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"e5722ead-8cd4-4006-8598-6cb24d15adbd","comment_uuid":"270ef305-7da8-4db2-9fcb-d25a35d74c80","author":"tLiK","content":"Second symptom, same address-mode root cause — broadens this issue to the full entry address-mode contract (PSP + BIOS). After the #51 tertiary fix, the 3 AM5 images advance past directory discovery and now fail here too.\n\nAM5 BIOS-entry manifestation (ASRock_B650, $BL2 @0x2ed000, entry 4):\n  type=0x62, size=0x500020, src=0x4000000001e02000, dst=0x9afffe0\nThe BIOS directory entry source is a 64-bit field whose TOP BITS select the address mode:\n  e0-e2: src top nibble 0x8000000000000000 (bit 63)\n  e4-e6: src top nibble 0x4000000000000000 (bit 62)\n  e3:    src=0, dst=0xa200000 (destination-based)\nOur tool masks src to the low bits (0x1e02000) and treats size 0x500020 literally -> 0x1e02000+0x500020 overruns the 32MB ROM -> \"truncated entry body\" parse error. Reference honors the mode bits (per PSPTool AddressMode: top-2-bits of the address select physical / rom-relative / dir-relative / other) and places the body correctly, so it does not error.\n\nThe EPYC symptom (entry 11 @0x1332000, ours 0x13c8000 = raw loc 0x3c8000 | 0x1000000) is the SAME contract for PSP 16B entries: we bias by a region base instead of honoring the entrys address mode.\n\nBoth live in the address.rs unit (route: upstream entry.py + directory.py; design doc .design/psptool-core/address.md still MISSING). Fixing the address-mode application should resolve all 5 local-corpus differential failures. Upstream ref: PSPTool address-mode masking in entry.py / blob.py (get_address_mode / the top-2-bit dispatch).","created_at":"2026-07-11T22:33:10.030757246Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAXaRG0HHbLwVprZbz8joSuJKC0WEm4SzTQtdOCdET5/V5Iyvo0GTB6e5IOtivoYgMW+XqWZF2Gu2Q5OmpUKP+DQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFk+pimrL2QpG8AzaaJsxzW1ostjDsk6JEfMX0q1QHDAID1Hq9Qcw4+umFuQ8R+tWFYO8mS4RjEEXs+rHw6NKgI="}
