{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":136,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T04:24:19.328416860Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"9c32a167-2ee4-47d4-ac8b-e4aebbeee0e1","title":"psptool-core: #51 tertiary walk discards block[20:24] Zen generation id (ls Generation column diverges)","description":"Steps to reproduce:\n1. \n\nExpected: \nActual: \n\nSee HATER.md (committed) for the full adversarial analysis + failure scenario. Found by the-hater (Fable) review of the session's production changes. directory.rs:782-806 tertiary_actual_offset/walk_directories follows the 0x48/0x4A pointer but does NOT propagate block[20:24] as the target directory's zen_generation. Upstream directory.py:88-95 sets zen_generation='Zen 4/5 (PSP ID 0x...)' from block[20:24] and psptool.py:84 prints it in the Generation column. Result: the tertiary-reached $PL2 dirs on the collected Zen4/5 images show wrong/blank Generation vs reference -> a differential divergence on exactly the images #51 targets. Completes the #51 fix. Committed corpus (Zen1-3) has no tertiary dirs so it's unaffected; pin with a synthetic tertiary fixture asserting gen propagation.","priority":"high","parent_uuid":"525d7258-de71-4087-8d5a-f7dd155266b5","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHrYMHYqFIbmlSknqWPNE8Gth7NHmH/Q9f6MMclHxjugTbjsqggHVqGehTgmDZ+4DhmrOunvVUQPiwHVkwVgUwQ="}
